        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8456, Mediterranean Single Cylinder Tuscany Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMediterranean home decor is characterized by fanciful, often floral stylings with a heavy influence of the old world. This Tuscany Bronze Single Cylinder Deadbolt is rustic, a beautiful yet simple door lock that is will add a bold, unique style to any door. The Mediterranean Single Cylinder Tuscany Deadbolt is available in either flat black or medium bronze finishes. It will fit doors 1-3/4 inches thick to 3-3/8 inches thick with backsets of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Lost Wax Cast Bronze Tuscany Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Cast bronze collar and rosette.</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with a extension collar for thin doors.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Rustic Tuscany Bronze Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Trim Diameter with Exterior Ring: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Trim Diameter without Exterior Ring: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Trim Projection with Exterior Ring: 1”</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Trim Projection without Exterior Ring: 11/16”</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Thickness: 5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-cast-bronze-finish.jpg?v=1704354518\" width=\"394\" height=\"189\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
